  "_readme": [
    "Expected Call A output for every post in posts.seed.json. Pipeline-owned",
    "(docs/roles/pipeline.md, Stage 0: 'post-analysis.mock.json, 10 expected",
    "outputs including one incident'). Hand-written against docs/03 sections",
    "3.1 and 4.1, not recorded from a model run.",
    "",
    "Two jobs. First, it is the target when tuning the Call A prompt: run",
    "`npm --workspace @living-city/pipeline run run:a` and diff against this.",
    "Second, it lets everything downstream of Call A - the aggregator, the",
    "validator, the plan routes - run with no API key and no spend:",
    "`npm --workspace @living-city/pipeline run run:all -- --offline`.",
    "",
    "Watch these five posts in particular:",
    "  p-007, p-020, p-022  the three seeded incidents (docs/04 section 3)",
    "  p-012, p-021         near-misses that must NOT produce an incident",
    "  p-011                prompt injection: data, never instructions (rule 13)",
    "",
    "image_evidence assumes the seed photos are reachable. They are not in the",
    "repo yet, so a live run will flag image_missing on those posts instead.",
    "That divergence is rule 9 working, not a failure."
